1
00:00:02,040 --> 00:00:03,180
杰森:早上好.
Jason: Good morning.

2
00:00:03,660 --> 00:00:07,240
麦琪:早上好,杰森.我收到第一封专栏的读者来信了.
Maggie: Morning, Jason.I just got my first fan letter from my column.

3
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:09,260
杰森:好.太好了.信上说什么了?
Jason: Good.That's wonderful.What's it say?

4
00:00:10,180 --> 00:00:11,200
麦琪:亲爱的马龙小姐,
Maggie: Dear Miss Malone,

5
00:00:11,660 --> 00:00:13,840
我从来就没想到猫产仔会有那么有趣.
I've never really given much thought to kitty litter,

6
00:00:14,100 --> 00:00:16,380
不过您最近的大作让我大开眼界.
but your recent article opened my eyes.

7
00:00:16,680 --> 00:00:21,200
现在我向您发誓,也许有一天我也去弄一只……猫.
Now I swear by "Tabby Fresh." Perhaps one day I'll get a ...... cat.

8
00:00:22,400 --> 00:00:26,000
杰森:很好.
Jason: Nice.

9
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:26,900
本:早上好.
Ben: Morning.

10
00:00:26,900 --> 00:00:27,700
麦琪:好.
Maggie: Morning.

11
00:00:29,020 --> 00:00:32,300
本:哦,爸爸,
Ben: Um, dad, I don't want you to be mad,

12
00:00:32,300 --> 00:00:33,960
我不想让您生气,但我找不着历史课本了.
but I can't find my history book.

13
00:00:34,340 --> 00:00:34,980
杰森:我为什么要生气呢?
Jason: Why would I be mad?

14
00:00:35,080 --> 00:00:37,360
本,我不是没有课本去上课的那个人,
I'm not the one who has to go to class without a book, Ben.

15
00:00:37,700 --> 00:00:40,160
而且我也不是那个还没准备就考试的人.
I'm not the one who has to take a test unprepared.

16
00:00:40,580 --> 00:00:43,660
本:不,但你是那个必须花25块钱让我再买一本的人.
Ben: No, but you're the one who has to cough up 25 bucks to replace it.

17
00:00:44,940 --> 00:00:46,900
杰森:不,不,不,不……我很抱歉,
Jason: No, no, no, no, no...I'm sorry, you're not listening, Ben.

18
00:00:47,040 --> 00:00:48,740
你没听我的话,本.不,我这次不会帮你了.
No, I'm not gonna bail you out this time.

19
00:00:50,960 --> 00:00:53,720
本:你说的对,爸爸.
Ben: You're right, dad, it's time for a tough love lesson.

20
00:00:54,540 --> 00:00:58,900
现在该对我上一堂粗暴父爱的课了.我要跌出前五名了,
I'm gonna drop out of fifth period.I can always sell "Mary Kay."

21
00:00:58,900 --> 00:00:59,880
我还要到大街上去卖艺,我的皮肤很不错.
I've got good skin.

22
00:01:01,760 --> 00:01:03,060
麦琪:够了,本.杰森,给他25块钱.
Maggie: Enough, Ben.Jason, give him twenty-five dollars.

23
00:01:04,200 --> 00:01:05,800
杰森:(叹气)我只有两张20的.
Jason: (groaning) I've only got two twenties here.

24
00:01:06,820 --> 00:01:07,500
本:你真是小气.
Ben: You're a prince.

25
00:01:07,500 --> 00:01:10,700
迈克:你好!哦,来份煎鸡蛋,快点.
Mike: Hello!Ah, scrambled, please.

26
00:01:11,940 --> 00:01:14,720
杰森:嘿,迈克,
Jason: Hey, Mike, did it ever occur to you that your mother is not just

27
00:01:14,720 --> 00:01:16,380
你是不是觉得她不是你妈妈,而是一个女佣呢?
some domestic drudge?

28
00:01:17,440 --> 00:01:21,020
迈克:不.呃,
Mike: No.Uh, dad, listen,

29
00:01:21,020 --> 00:01:22,400
爸爸,听我说,我一门大学课程出了个小问题.
I'm having a little problem with one of my college classes.

30
00:01:22,400 --> 00:01:23,500
杰森:不及格了?
Jason: Attending:

31
00:01:24,680 --> 00:01:27,740
迈克:不不,爸爸.我似乎找不着我社会学课本了.
Mike: No, no, dad.I just can't seem to find my sociology book.

32
00:01:29,940 --> 00:01:32,600
杰森:如果我不给你25块钱买本新的,
Jason: And you're probably gonna have to sell "Mary Kay" if I don't come

33
00:01:32,600 --> 00:01:34,380
你是不是要街上去卖艺呢?
up with 25 bucks to replace it.

34
00:01:35,100 --> 00:01:36,120
迈克:不,我去卖身.啊,不过,
Mike: No, it was "Thigh-masters."

35
00:01:39,700 --> 00:01:40,800
爸爸,实际上,你得给我35块.
Ah, but dad, actually it was thirty-five dollars.

36
00:01:41,900 --> 00:01:45,300
麦琪:迈克,
Maggie: Mike, Ben just took your father's last forty dollars for his lost

37
00:01:45,300 --> 00:01:46,140
本刚才拿走你爸爸最后40块钱去买历史课本了.
history book.

38
00:01:46,200 --> 00:01:50,200
迈克:(笑)那个臭小子!
Mike: (laughing) That little leach!

39
00:01:50,900 --> 00:01:52,200
麦琪:哦,我希望你也可以吃迈克的鸡蛋.
Maggie: Well, I hope you can eat Mike's eggs, too.

40
00:01:52,200 --> 00:01:53,100
杰森:抱歉.
Jason: Sorry.

41
00:01:53,100 --> 00:01:53,700
麦琪:(尖叫)
Maggie: (screaming)

42
00:01:54,880 --> 00:01:55,940
杰森:好了,我努力一下.
Jason: Okay, I'll try.

43
00:01:57,740 --> 00:02:00,620
麦琪:黛比·迪哈特获得了普利策新闻奖?
Maggie: Debbie Teighart won the Pulitzer Prize for journalism?

44
00:02:01,260 --> 00:02:01,520
杰森:谁是黛比?
Jason: Debbie who?

45
00:02:02,480 --> 00:02:04,640
麦琪:我大学时候的室友.
Maggie: My old college roommate.

46
00:02:04,960 --> 00:02:07,640
杰森:你的一个老朋友得了普利策奖?太棒了.
Jason: Somebody you know won the Pulitzer?That's great.

47
00:02:07,820 --> 00:02:13,060
麦琪:哦,是的.真是个好消息,可以愉快地开始新的一天了.
Maggie: Oh, yeah.Just the kind of good news you want to start your day.

48
00:03:24,920 --> 00:03:27,920
杰森:你的朋友获得了普利策奖,你就这个样子?
Jason: Friend of yours wins the Pulitzer, and you puree the paper?

49
00:03:28,280 --> 00:03:30,140
麦琪:杰森,你还记得黛比·迪哈特吗?
Maggie: Jason, don't you remember Debbie Teighart?

50
00:03:31,060 --> 00:03:33,340
那个让我大学四年如同生活在地狱里的人
The one who made my life a living hell for four years?

51
00:03:33,620 --> 00:03:34,400
杰森:没有印象了.
Jason: Doesn't ring a bell.

52
00:03:34,660 --> 00:03:37,200
麦琪:就是那个"只要男人有一口气,我就爱上他"的黛比·迪哈特啊.
Maggie: Debbie "if he's breathing, I'll jump him" Teighart?

53
00:03:37,300 --> 00:03:42,300
杰森:哦,呵呵,是的!是的!个子不高,深色皮肤,乱蓬蓬的发型.
Jason: Oh, ho, ho, yeah!Yeah!Short, short brunette, shag haircut?

54
00:03:44,500 --> 00:03:45,440
麦琪:我早就知道!
Maggie: I knew it!

55
00:03:46,000 --> 00:03:47,020
杰森:我总是对她说"不"的.
Jason: I always said "no."

56
00:03:47,100 --> 00:03:53,400
麦琪:哦!杰森,她可什么事都做的出.记得教我新闻学的老教授,鲁特格先生吗?哦,呵呵,我确信她上了他的……
Maggie: Oh!Jason, she'd do anything to get ahead.Remember my old journalism professer, Mr.Rutger?Oh, ho, ho, I bet she was sleeping....

57
00:03:53,400 --> 00:03:54,200
克莉丝:嗨!
Chrissy: Hi!

58
00:03:56,300 --> 00:03:57,700
麦琪:……他的帐篷里了.
Maggie: ....in a canopy bed.

59
00:03:59,040 --> 00:04:01,600
克莉丝:别生气,我把拼写课本丢了.
Chrissy: Don't get mad, but I lost my spelling book.

60
00:04:03,880 --> 00:04:06,900
杰森:那这是不是说,呃,你要35块钱去买本新的?
Jason: Would this by any chance cost, ooooh, say, thirty-five dollars to replace?

61
00:04:06,900 --> 00:04:10,200
克莉丝:哦-哦!
Chrissy: Oh-oh!

62
00:04:12,140 --> 00:04:13,600
杰森:别想了,迈克!
Jason: Give it up, Mike!

63
00:04:13,600 --> 00:04:15,000
迈克:我非要试试!
Mike: I had to try!

64
00:04:17,720 --> 00:04:19,360
麦琪:哦,杰森,
Maggie: Oh, Jason, life is funny.

65
00:04:20,120 --> 00:04:22,960
生活真有意思.人家黛比·迪哈特拿起了普利策奖,我却在拿着早点.
Here Debbie Teighart is picking up a Pulitzer, and

66
00:04:22,960 --> 00:04:24,000
I'm picking up....soggy Cheeri-O's

67
00:04:25,860 --> 00:04:28,140
杰森:哦,你反应太激烈了,
Jason: Oh, you're also overreacting, Maggie.

68
00:04:28,780 --> 00:04:33,900
麦琪.你并不是一个整天忙家务的人.没擦干净!
You are not just a person who does menial chores all day.Missed a spot!

69
00:04:36,300 --> 00:04:38,240
(笑)你是个称职的家庭主妇,麦琪.
laughing) You're a great housewife, Maggie,

70
00:04:38,240 --> 00:04:40,660
(可你还是个超级棒的记者.
but you're also a damn fine journalist.

71
00:04:40,760 --> 00:04:44,760
麦琪:哦,是的.
Maggie: Oh, sure.Here Debbie's writing about acid rain,

72
00:04:44,760 --> 00:04:48,460
黛比现在写的是酸雨现象,我写的是……哦,真难以启齿……小猫.
and I'm writing about...well, I'll just say it....kitty doo-doo.

73
00:04:49,800 --> 00:04:52,460
杰森:是的,不过,你写的非常出色.
Jason: Yeah, but you wrote the hell out of that.

74
00:04:53,700 --> 00:04:55,520
麦琪:杰森,我真不懂.
Maggie: Jason, I don't understand it.

75
00:04:55,520 --> 00:04:58,840
黛比以前连两个句子都连不起来,她能得普利策奖?哈!
Debbie couldn't string two sentences together, and she wins the Pulitzer?Ha!

76
00:04:59,600 --> 00:05:01,620
她也许跟评委睡觉了!你觉得我很小气,
She was probably sleeping with the judges!

77
00:05:04,640 --> 00:05:06,480
是不是?
You think I'm being petty, don't you?

78
00:05:06,500 --> 00:05:07,580
杰森:不,不,不,不,不.
Jason: No, no, no, no, no.

79
00:05:08,100 --> 00:05:09,780
麦琪:你说的对.我是小气.
Maggie: You're right, I am.

80
00:05:09,780 --> 00:05:13,640
也许黛比真的成了一个优秀的记者.
You know, maybe Debbie's turned herself into a real journalist.

81
00:05:14,180 --> 00:05:19,300
你知道,是个大度的人,我要打电话向她表示祝贺.
You know, I'm a big enough person.I'm going to call and congratulate her.

82
00:05:19,360 --> 00:05:20,220
杰森:这样就好.
Jason: That's better.

83
00:05:25,480 --> 00:05:29,540
麦琪:(打电话)是的,请帮我找一下黛比·迪哈特.是的,我是她的老朋友,麦琪·马龙,<长岛哨兵>报的.
Maggie: (on phone) Yes, Debbie Teighart in features, please.Yes, this is an old friend

84
00:05:29,540 --> 00:05:30,700
of hers, Maggie Malone, from the "Long Island Sentinal

85
00:05:32,820 --> 00:05:44,280
是的,很要紧.她可以在8月份回我的电话!哦,
Yes, seriously.She can return my call in August!Well, uh, yes, yes!

86
00:05:44,280 --> 00:05:46,780
是的,是的!我还是留个口信吧(搅拌机的噪音)
I would like to leave a message(blender noises).

87
00:05:57,000 --> 00:06:01,280
本:好了,我们在来一遍.
Ben: Okay, let's go over this again.You're in the park, you see the babe.

88
00:06:01,720 --> 00:06:02,300
你在公园里看到了那个小妞.你说什么?
What do you say?

89
00:06:03,040 --> 00:06:05,600
克莉丝:我叫克莉丝,我迷路了.你能帮我找到我的哥哥,本吗?
Chrissy: I'm Chrissy, and I'm lost.Can you help me find my brother, Ben?

90
00:06:05,600 --> 00:06:09,000
本:我的"帅"哥哥,本.
Ben: My "studdly" brother, Ben.

91
00:06:10,840 --> 00:06:12,540
克莉丝:然后,我就可以得到冰激凌吗?
Chrissy: And then I get the ice cream?

92
00:06:12,780 --> 00:06:14,480
迈克:告诉你了,我给你买冰激凌,
Mike: Tell you what; I'll get you some ice cream,

93
00:06:14,480 --> 00:06:15,620
你什么都不用做.
and you don't have to do anything.

94
00:06:15,820 --> 00:06:20,220
克莉丝:太好了!我去拿我的外衣.你去找你的女孩!
Chrissy: Great!I'll go get my coat.You find your own babes!

95
00:06:22,800 --> 00:06:24,120
本:嘿!你在干什么?
Ben: Hey!What are you doing?

96
00:06:24,160 --> 00:06:27,220
迈克:你坏了我的好事,现在我也来坏你的.
Mike: You blew my scam, Sam.Now I'm blowing yours.

97
00:06:27,340 --> 00:06:29,140
你知道,丢课本的计策是我先想起来的.
You knew I had a whole lost book thing ready.

98
00:06:29,360 --> 00:06:31,300
本:那有怎么样?我先下手了.
Ben: So?I got there first.

99
00:06:31,500 --> 00:06:35,580
迈克:听着,小子,你还在咿呀学语的时候,这一手我已经玩的炉火纯青了.
Mike: Listen, Junior.I perfected that scam while you were still saying "Pisketti."

100
00:06:37,080 --> 00:06:39,160
克莉丝:能给我买石板街冰激凌吗?
Chrissy: Can I get Rocky Road?

101
00:06:40,080 --> 00:06:42,060
迈克:没问题!记住,
Mike: Absolutely!And remember, Chrissy;

102
00:06:42,060 --> 00:06:42,700
克莉丝,这个周六的晚上,你想要谁陪你啊?
who do we ask for when we need a babysitter this Saturday night?

103
00:06:42,700 --> 00:06:51,000
克莉丝:我的税哥哥,本.
Chrissy: My studdly brother, Ben.

104
00:06:52,860 --> 00:06:54,060
本:这是什么东西?
Ben: What's all that stuff?

105
00:06:54,060 --> 00:06:56,000
麦琪:啊,是我在大学里得的.
Maggie: Ah, some of my old college papers.

106
00:06:56,000 --> 00:06:59,200
本:奖状?妈妈,你怎么不贴在墙上呢?
Ben: An award?Mom, why isn't this on the wall?

107
00:07:01,300 --> 00:07:03,100
麦琪:哦,这只是小奖励.
Maggie: Oh, it's just a little award.

108
00:07:03,120 --> 00:07:07,580
不过,我真的打败了50所大学里的学生,包括哈佛和耶鲁的.
But, I did beat out students from fifty schools, including Harvard and Yale.

109
00:07:08,960 --> 00:07:14,820
本:哇噢!1969年!真是一件古董!嘿,这是什么?
Ben: Wow!1969!This thing's an antique!Hey, what's that?

110
00:07:15,220 --> 00:07:16,680
麦琪:我20岁时立下的宏伟目标.(笑)
Maggie: A list of goals I made when I was twenty (laughing).

111
00:07:17,960 --> 00:07:21,260
本:成为第一位战地女记,学会斯瓦西里语,
Ben: Become the first woman war correspondent, learn Swahili,

112
00:07:22,060 --> 00:07:23,620
35岁时出版一部小说.
have a novel published by age thirty-five.

113
00:07:25,320 --> 00:07:29,380
我不相信你这些目标真的都实现了.路还长着呢,妈妈.
I can't believe you actually did all these things.Way to go, mom!

114
00:07:29,660 --> 00:07:33,180
麦琪:哦,是的,还没都实现呢.只是想检查检查.
Maggie: Oh, well.Not everything, I'm afraid.Just the ones that are checked.

115
00:07:33,800 --> 00:07:36,260
本:哦,振作点.
Ben: Oh, come on.I mean, you did a lot of things here.

116
00:07:36,440 --> 00:07:38,960
你已经做了很多事了.
I mean, how many people have actually, um, umm, ....

117
00:07:44,500 --> 00:07:46,080
我是说,有多少人真的学会驾驶手排挡汽车了?
learned to drive a stick-shift?

118
00:07:58,280 --> 00:08:01,420
杰森:要么让我抱着枕头睡觉,要么我们去体操馆锻炼.
Jason: Either I'm hugging a pillow, or we've got to join a gym.

119
00:08:06,100 --> 00:08:09,040
哦,麦琪,别再重温你那些目标了.
Oh, Maggie, not that old list again!

120
00:08:09,660 --> 00:08:12,460
麦琪:你能相信吗,我还没去过苏联呢?
Maggie: Can you believe I never toured the Soviet Union?

121
00:08:14,740 --> 00:08:18,500
杰森:没去才好呢.现在没苏联了.划掉这个目标.
Jason: It's good you didn't.Now there is no Soviet Union.Check it off!

122
00:08:20,840 --> 00:08:23,960
麦琪:解体的国家无所谓.这是个目标.
Maggie: Fallen nations don't count.It was a goal.

123
00:08:24,540 --> 00:08:25,600
杰森:亲爱的,黛比·迪哈特那件事给你很大的刺激,是不是?
Jason: Boy, this Debbie Teighart thing has really gotten to you, hasn't it?

124
00:08:27,840 --> 00:08:29,160
麦琪:哦,才不是呢.
Maggie: Oh, not at all.

125
00:08:29,360 --> 00:08:32,280
黛比·迪哈特用她那吸尘器般的嘴唇拿下了破普利策奖这事我根本不在乎.
I could care less that Debbie "vacuum lips" Teighart lucked

126
00:08:33,500 --> 00:08:34,700
into a stinking Pulitzer

127
00:08:36,940 --> 00:08:38,760
杰森:哦,你能这么想我很高兴.
Jason: Well, I'm glad to see it's out of your system.

128
00:08:40,260 --> 00:08:43,320
麦琪:杰森,这也许是黛比引起来的,
Maggie: Jason, this may have started out with Debbie, but now it's about me,

129
00:08:43,440 --> 00:08:47,360
但我是为自己的那些没有实现的目标而伤心.我相信你的目标都实现了.
my failed goals.I bet you accomplished everything on your list.

130
00:08:49,380 --> 00:08:51,260
杰森:哦……麦琪……算了吧,
Jason: Well....Maggie....Come on,

131
00:08:51,420 --> 00:08:53,540
我也跟你一样有痛苦和失落.
I've had my share of pain and disappointment.

132
00:08:53,680 --> 00:08:56,740
麦琪:什么?你没见过赫伯·阿尔帕特和提加纳布拉斯乐队吗?
Maggie: What?You never got to meet Herb Alpert and the Tijuana Brass?

133
00:08:59,020 --> 00:09:00,460
杰森:我只到了门口.
Jason: I met the brass.

134
00:09:01,860 --> 00:09:04,080
麦琪:谢谢你.这让我感觉好多了.
Maggie: Thank you.That makes me feel so much better.

135
00:09:04,620 --> 00:09:07,000
杰森:哦!你取得了很多的成功,麦琪.你在<新闻周刊>和"第19频道"都干过.
Jason: Oh!You've had a lot of success, Maggie.You worked at Newsweek, and Channel

