00:16:01,420 --> 00:16:05,300
迈克:嘿!对不起,舞会狂.你在这里没戏.
Mike: Hey!Sorry, party dog, but you've been fixed.

280
00:16:06,280 --> 00:16:09,520
本:不行.肯尼带来一个放音师和一帮浓妆艳抹的姑娘.
Ben: No way!Kenny's bringing a DJ and a bunch of party girls wearing too

281
00:16:09,520 --> 00:16:11,500
这个地方是我的.
much make-up.So this place is mine.

282
00:16:12,560 --> 00:16:15,660
迈克:好的,好的.
Mike: All right, all right.I'll level with you, Ben.Now listen.

283
00:16:15,740 --> 00:16:17,100
我把它留给你,本.现在听着,
Now, I don't need this place for me.

284
00:16:17,100 --> 00:16:19,920
我不是自己需要这个地方,是一些城市里的贫苦孩子来参观.
I need it for a group of underprivileged inner-city kids.

285
00:16:21,460 --> 00:16:22,380
本:真的?干什么?
Ben: Really?What for?

286
00:16:23,200 --> 00:16:25,600
迈克:哦,这就像是郊区一日游什么的.本,
Mike: Well, it's kind of like a suburbia day-trip for 'em, Ben.

287
00:16:25,600 --> 00:16:28,460
这些孩子有的从没见过草坪洒水车和其他一些城里没有的东西.
I mean, some of these kids have never even seen a lawn sprinkler,

288
00:16:28,460 --> 00:16:30,440
or so much as a refrigerator magnet.

289
00:16:32,440 --> 00:16:36,960
本:等等.你什么时候关心起贫苦儿童来了.
Ben: Wait.You don't care a rat's hat about underprivileged kids.

290
00:16:37,520 --> 00:16:38,820
迈克:哦,是吗?
Mike: Oh, yeah?Well, here!

291
00:16:38,860 --> 00:16:42,440
我说,你为什么不把这话说给小阿方索,曼纽尔和哈维听呢?
Why don't you tell that to little Alfonso, Manuel and Harvey.

292
00:16:45,420 --> 00:16:47,320
本:你应该上周就通知我,我已经邀请整个学校的同学来了.
Ben: I wish you'd have told me this last week,

293
00:16:47,320 --> 00:16:52,460
嘿!你在骗我!
before I invited the whole school.Hey!That's Menudo!

294
00:16:54,620 --> 00:16:56,880
你买那个钱夹就是我陪你去的.
I was with you when you bought that wallet.

295
00:16:58,960 --> 00:17:01,600
是不是准备和描着黑眼线的姑娘玩啊.
Get ready for some babes in heavy eyeliner.

296
00:17:03,400 --> 00:17:12,700
麦琪:(喊叫,尖叫)
Maggie: (yelling, screaming)

297
00:17:12,700 --> 00:17:15,600
杰森:我们给你解开了,你可以下去了.
Jason: We've got you untangled.You can go down now.

298
00:17:15,600 --> 00:17:21,200
麦琪:你确认!
Maggie: Wanna bet!

299
00:17:21,200 --> 00:17:26,500
麦琪和杰森:(喊叫)
Maggie and Jason: (yelling)

300
00:17:30,120 --> 00:17:33,880
麦琪,这可以补偿许多没过的纪念日了.
Jason: Maggie, this ought to make up for a lot of anniversaries.

301
00:17:34,600 --> 00:17:35,820
麦琪:亲爱的,我一直想着呢.
Maggie: Honey, I've been thinking.

302
00:17:35,820 --> 00:17:41,400
杰森:哦,是不是因为这,我们才陷到这么危险的境地呢?那些石头上为什么会有红红的东西呢?
Jason: Well, isn't that what got us into this predicament in the first place?Why are there red stains all over those rocks?

303
00:17:44,480 --> 00:17:44,500
麦琪:哦,杰森!别说了!我还指望你是个理性的人呢.
Maggie: Oh, Jason!Stop that!I'm counting on you to be the rational one.

304
00:17:44,500 --> 00:17:49,800
杰森:哦-哦.你像风铃一样的摇摆,我很难保持理性,麦琪.
Jason: Uh-huh.Hard to be rational when you're dangling like a wind chime, Maggie.

305
00:17:49,800 --> 00:17:51,600
麦琪:(叫喊)杰森,检查一下我的想法.
Maggie: (yelling) Jason, check my thinking here.

306
00:17:55,400 --> 00:17:55,740
杰森:哦-哦.
Jason: Uh-huh.

307
00:17:55,740 --> 00:17:56,200
麦琪:攀岩只是个象征.实际上,这并不能让我更优秀.
Maggie: Rappelling is just symbolic.It doesn't make me a better person in and of itself.

308
00:17:56,200 --> 00:17:57,400
杰森:对.
Jason: True.

309
00:18:01,560 --> 00:18:04,820
麦琪:所以,也许是因为工作紧张和到了更年期,
Maggie: So.Considering my career anxiety and mid-life panic,

310
00:18:05,500 --> 00:18:07,440
我才想做点疯狂的事.
I might just be doing something crazy.

311
00:18:08,120 --> 00:18:09,240
杰森:完全赞同.
Jason: No argument here.

312
00:18:10,220 --> 00:18:13,080
麦琪:所以,亲爱的,请告诉我忘记这一切,我们回家吧.
Maggie: So, honey, please tell me it's okay to forget this and go home.

313
00:18:13,180 --> 00:18:14,460
杰森:这就是你想让我说的吗,麦琪?
Jason: Is that what you want me to say, Maggie?

314
00:18:14,760 --> 00:18:16,180
麦琪:帮帮我,杰森.
Maggie: Work with me here, Jason.

315
00:18:16,860 --> 00:18:18,800
杰森:好吧,放弃,回家.
Jason: It's okay to quit and go home!

316
00:18:19,540 --> 00:18:20,700
麦琪:你必须要说放弃吗?
Maggie: Did you have to say quit?

317
00:18:20,700 --> 00:18:24,340
你不能说"坚持下去"或"清醒一下"吗?
Couldn't you say "hang in there" or "come to your senses?"

318
00:18:25,040 --> 00:18:28,220
杰森:好吧,麦琪.这种情况下有两种选择:上去或下去.
Jason: All right, Maggie.There are two ways out of this situation.Up or down.

319
00:18:28,560 --> 00:18:29,280
麦琪:就两种吗?
Maggie: That's it?

320
00:18:29,840 --> 00:18:32,040
杰森:哦,我很想和你在这里共度余生,
Jason: Well, we could spend our golden years here,

321
00:18:32,060 --> 00:18:33,460
但我怕孩子们不来看我们.
but I doubt the kids would visit.

322
00:18:33,540 --> 00:18:36,120
麦琪:哦,杰森.我觉得这一点都不好笑.
Maggie: Oh, Jason, I don't think that's very funny.

323
00:18:36,960 --> 00:18:39,500
杰森:麦琪,想让我直说吗?好吧,那我就直说.
Jason: Maggie, want straight talk, sweetheart?Well, here it is.Okay.

324
00:18:39,920 --> 00:18:43,460
要么你现在就让肯特把你拉回到安全地带,还像以前那样的生活.
You can either have Kent pull you back up into that comfort zone and be

325
00:18:43,460 --> 00:18:47,220
这很好.要么你就坚强起来,麦琪.
the person you've always been, which is fine.Or you can be tough, Maggie.

326
00:18:47,460 --> 00:18:49,240
面对大山显示你才是征服者.这种冒险你到死也不会忘记……我们的年龄也不小了.
You can show this mountain who's boss.

327
00:18:49,400 --> 00:18:52,980
You can have an adventure you'll remember 'til your dying day...

328
00:18:53,020 --> 00:18:54,620
which isn't for many years.

329
00:18:58,580 --> 00:19:03,600
麦琪:好的.好的,肯特.好的,准备好了吗?
Maggie: Okay.Okay, Kent.All right.Are you ready?

330
00:19:03,600 --> 00:19:05,800
肯特:(喊叫)来吧!
Kent: (yelling) Go for it!

331
00:19:11,480 --> 00:19:17,880
麦琪:1…2…3!(喊叫)黛比·迪哈特,这才是普利策奖!
Maggie: One...two....three!(yelling) Pulitzer this, Debbie Teighart!

332
00:19:22,000 --> 00:19:25,860
迈克:放弃吧,本.我比你大,比你有经验.
Mike: Give it up, Ben.I'm older, more experienced than you are.

333
00:19:26,220 --> 00:19:27,720
本:你都生锈了,过时了.
Ben: You're rusty and out of practice.

334
00:19:29,440 --> 00:19:31,920
迈克:哦,也许你应该问问自己:你的晚会呢?
Mike: Well, maybe you should ask yourself this: where's your party?

335
00:19:32,020 --> 00:19:33,000
本:那你的摄制组呢?
Ben: Where's your film crew?

336
00:19:33,760 --> 00:19:36,620
迈克:他们快来了.但你的晚会泡汤了.
Mike: They'll be here.But your party is history.

337
00:19:36,700 --> 00:19:39,140
我放出话去了,你有舞伴了.
I spread the word that you were having chaperones.

338
00:19:39,900 --> 00:19:41,180
本:你太幼稚了.我早知道这样,
Ben: You're so simple.

339
00:19:42,920 --> 00:19:46,340
就告诉每个人本的舞伴就是你们.
I knew that, and told everybody the chaperones were 19-year-old au-pairs.

340
00:19:48,340 --> 00:19:50,960
而你不知道的是,我给你的摄制组打了电话,
What you don't know is that I called your film crew and rescheduled for

341
00:19:50,960 --> 00:19:51,540
把日期推迟到了复活节.
Easter.

342
00:19:53,480 --> 00:19:54,900
迈克:你这个该死的骗子.
Mike: Poor, deceived wretch.

343
00:19:55,940 --> 00:19:58,480
可他们知道只有密码指令才算数.
They know only to take instructions with a codeword.

344
00:19:59,720 --> 00:20:00,300
本:三角洲黎明?
Ben: Delta Dawn?

345
00:20:04,400 --> 00:20:05,220
迈克:你知道?
Mike: You knew?

346
00:20:05,900 --> 00:20:10,900
本:我知道的密码指令多着呢.再见了,摄制组.
Ben: There are other extensions in this house.Hasta la vista, film crew.

347
00:20:12,800 --> 00:20:14,800
迈克:别高兴的太早.也许你应该去大门看看吧.我觉得那里应该有什么东西.
Mike: Well, before you gloat, maybe you should check out the front door.I think there's something out there.

348
00:20:14,800 --> 00:20:22,800
本:哦,当然有什么东西了.现场舞会,本主办.
Ben: Oh, there's something out there all right.Instant party.Just add Ben.

349
00:20:26,240 --> 00:20:28,100
本:警戒线?不得越过?
Ben: Police lines?Do not cross?

350
00:20:28,860 --> 00:20:29,700
迈克:念念通知.
Mike: Read the sign.

351
00:20:30,100 --> 00:20:32,580
本:因患淋巴腺鼠疫,舞会取消!
Ben: Party is cancelled due to the bubonic plague!

352
00:20:34,800 --> 00:20:35,600
迈克:再见了,舞会.
Mike: Hasta la vista, party.

353
00:20:35,600 --> 00:20:40,700
本:你这么做到底想干什么?你在这屋子里猖狂好多年了!什么时候才轮到我.
Ben: What'd you go and do that for?C'mon, you've been scamming freely in this house for years!When's it gonna be my turn?

354
00:20:44,420 --> 00:20:46,840
迈克:嘿,嘿.你轮到过.我得扁桃体炎的时候.
Mike: Hey, you had your turn!When I had my tonsils out.

355
00:20:47,320 --> 00:20:48,640
本:我才3岁.
Ben: I was three!

356
00:20:53,600 --> 00:20:57,700
迈克:你知道,本,我一直在想,昨晚你也没睡好吧?
Mike: You know, Ben, I've been thinking.Was your night as miserable as mine?

357
00:20:57,700 --> 00:21:01,900
本:谁说的?我睡得好极了.
Ben: Are you kidding?I watched "Star Search."

358
00:21:01,900 --> 00:21:07,500
迈克:噢.我们现实点吧.我500块钱没有弄到手.你的舞会也没开成.
Mike: Well, let's face it.I mean, I didn't get my five hundred dollars.You didn't get to have your party.

359
00:21:11,040 --> 00:21:12,100
本:你在说什么呢?
Ben: So what are you saying?

360
00:21:12,420 --> 00:21:16,220
迈克:哦,我是说,
Mike: Well, I'm saying that if I haven't used a scam for one calendar year,

361
00:21:16,220 --> 00:21:17,420
如果我一年不耍心眼,这里就是你说了算.
it's all yours.

362
00:21:17,940 --> 00:21:20,100
本:也包括开爸爸的车去机场,
Ben: Does that include taking dad's car to the airport,

363
00:21:20,100 --> 00:21:20,980
并用作出租车吗?
and using it as a gypsy cab?

364
00:21:22,460 --> 00:21:23,760
克莉丝:看谁来了!
Chrissy: Look who's here!

365
00:21:23,760 --> 00:21:23,860
迈克:嘿,回来了!
Ben: Mom, dad, you're alive!

366
00:21:24,600 --> 00:21:25,260
本:妈妈,爸爸,你们还活着!
Mike: Hey, guys!

367
00:21:26,360 --> 00:21:29,400
麦琪:是的!猜猜看.我做到了!
Maggie: Yep!And guess what?I did it!

368
00:21:29,560 --> 00:21:30,300
迈克:太好了!祝贺你!真不敢相信!我的父母去攀岩了.
Mike: All right!Congratulations!I can't believe it!My parents; rappelling.

369
00:21:30,300 --> 00:21:36,200
麦琪:(笑)实际上,一架直升机救了你爸爸.
Maggie: (laughing) Actually, a helicopter came for your father.

370
00:21:39,780 --> 00:21:41,780
麦琪:嘿,攀岩可不是我的目标.
Jason: Hey, rapelling wasn't on my list.

371
00:21:42,840 --> 00:21:43,600
麦琪:好了.我感觉自己完全变了样.没有什么我做不到的了.
Maggie: Well, I feel like a whole new Maggie.There's nothing I can do now.

372
00:21:43,600 --> 00:21:46,000
杰森:幸亏定目标之前蹦极还没出现呢.
Jason: Just like you Maggie before they invented bungee jumping.

373
00:21:46,000 --> 00:21:53,100
麦琪:噢,亲爱的.蹦极!多好的主意啊!我去打电话为我们这一周安排一次.
Maggie: Oh, honey, bungee jumping!What a great idea!I'm gonna go make an appointment for us this week.

374
00:21:53,100 --> 00:21:55,300
杰森:别!别!别!Maggie,不要.
Jason: No!No!No!Mag, no.

375
00:21:58,760 --> 00:22:00,640
麦琪:还记得我昨晚在宾馆给你说的话了?
Maggie: Do you remember last night at the lodge?

376
00:22:00,640 --> 00:22:07,400
杰森:是的,我记得.我和你妈要去……蹦极.
Jason: Yes, I do.Your mother and I are going....bungee jumping.

377
00:22:07,400 --> 00:22:09,200
杰森:你们能不能帮我把行李下卸下来?
Jason: You guys wanna help me unpack the car?

378
00:22:12,920 --> 00:22:15,720
克莉丝:爸爸,我能不能也去蹦极啊?
Chrissy: Daddy, can I jump over Benji, too?

379
00:22:27,600 --> 00:22:32,900
麦琪:(叹气)(写)绳索有半英寸粗,重量很轻,我很轻易就绑在安全带上.
Maggie: (sighing) (writing) The rope was half an inch in diameter, light enough for me to carry on my belt without noticing.

380
00:22:32,900 --> 00:22:41,300
但我悬挂在那里.我和死亡之间只有这根绳子.我想到了丈夫,家庭和工作.
我终于认识到我是一个幸运的女人,能够拥有这一切..
00:22:41,300
But there I hung; with only that rope between me and death.I saw my husband, my family, my career. And I realized that I'm one of those lucky women who really does have it all.
